Weix uses the Config.Cipher object layout and XOR mask documented in
fanyuantaier/wechatauto-replica's wechatauto/db.py (Apache License 2.0).
Source: https://github.com/fanyuantaier/wechatauto-replica/blob/main/wechatauto/db.py
Retrieved: 2026-09-30

Weix implements its own bounded, cancellable scan and validates every key
against the corresponding local SQLCipher database before accepting it.
